OL,3,GNEWSAMarvel fans to meet Welsh
OL,4,Asuperhero - complete with Cardiff
OL,5,Aaccent
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpoiler warning: This article reveals
OL,8,Fdetails from the VisionQuest series
OL,10,FMarvel fans around the world are set to
OL,11,Fmeet a Welsh villain - complete with a
OL,12,FCardiff accent.
OL,14,FLauren Morais, from the Welsh capital,
OL,15,Fwill play Lisa Molinari in the new
OL,16,Fsuperhero series VisionQuest - a
OL,17,Fspin-off from the miniseries
OL,18,FWandaVision.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
